%%{init: { 'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': { 'background': '#ffffff' } }}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant F as Frontend
    participant SM as Security Middleware
    participant AS as Auth Service
    participant SS as Security Service
    participant WS as WebAuthn Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant R as Redis

    Note over U,R: Enhanced Authentication with Behavioral Analysis

    U->>B: Access Login
    B->>F: Load Login Page
    F->>SM: POST /auth/login/options

    Note over SM: Multi-Layer Security Checks
    SM->>SM: Rate Limit Validation
    SM->>SM: Device Fingerprint Generation
    SM->>SM: Geographic Analysis

    SM->>AS: Validated Request
    AS->>DB: Find User
    AS->>SS: Check Account Lockout
    AS->>SS: Detect Suspicious Activity

    Note over SS: Behavioral Analysis
    SS->>SS: Analyze Access Patterns
    SS->>SS: Check Device History
    SS->>SS: Geographic Anomaly Detection

    AS->>WS: Generate Auth Options
    WS->>DB: Get Active Credentials
    WS->>WS: Filter Valid Credentials
    WS->>WS: Enhanced Security Extensions

    WS-->>AS: Authentication Options
    AS->>R: Store Challenge + Security Metadata
    AS->>SS: Log Security Event
    AS-->>F: Authentication Options

    F->>B: navigator.credentials.get()
    B->>U: Biometric Prompt
    U->>B: Biometric Input

    Note over B: Hardware Validation
    B->>B: Liveness Detection
    B->>B: User Verification Required
    B->>B: Platform Authenticator

    B-->>F: WebAuthn Assertion
    F->>SM: POST /auth/login/verify

    Note over SM: Comprehensive Security Validation
    SM->>SM: Device Consistency Check
    SM->>SM: Anti-Replay Protection
    SM->>SM: Request Integrity Validation

    SM->>AS: Validated Assertion
    AS->>R: Retrieve Challenge Data
    AS->>SS: Enhanced Biometric Validation

    Note over SS: Anti-Spoofing Checks
    SS->>SS: Liveness Validation
    SS->>SS: Presentation Attack Detection
    SS->>SS: Sign Count Progression Check

    AS->>WS: Verify Authentication
    WS->>DB: Get Stored Credential
    WS->>WS: WebAuthn Verification
    WS->>WS: Sign Count Validation
    WS->>WS: Authenticator Data Validation

    WS->>DB: Update Sign Count
    AS->>DB: Create Secure Session
    AS->>SS: Log Success Event
    AS-->>F: Authentication Success + Tokens
    F-->>U: Login Complete

    Note over U,R: Continuous Security Monitoring
    AS->>SS: Monitor Session Activity
    SS->>SS: Behavioral Pattern Analysis
    SS->>SS: Anomaly Detection
